      "type": "text",
      "x": 270,
      "y": 3480,
      "width": 825,
      "height": 160,
      "fontSize": 32,
      "text": "异步：返回与完成分离\nPromise 表达操作的结果\nawait 挂起依赖它的续段\nasync / await 本身不建立线程",
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "异步：返回与完成分离\nPromise 表达操作的结果\nawait 挂起依赖它的续段\nasync / await 本身不建立线程"
